      "summaries": {
        "en": "ShareX is a free, open-source screen capture and file sharing tool that streamlines capturing, annotating, and uploading screenshots or recordings. Its key strength lies in its extensive customization: users can define workflows with custom hotkeys, choose from over 80 upload destinations (e.g., Imgur, Dropbox), and apply post-capture actions like OCR or image effects. Built in C#, it offers a lightweight yet powerful alternative to proprietary tools. Developers can extend its functionality via plugins or integrate it into automation pipelines. Ideal for developers, designers, and anyone needing efficient visual communication.",
        "zh": "ShareX 是一款免费开源的屏幕截图与文件分享工具，核心优势在于高度可定制的工作流：支持自定义快捷键、80余个上传目标（如Imgur、Dropbox），并自动执行OCR识别、水印添加等后处理操作。基于C#开发，轻量且功能强大，可通过插件扩展或集成至自动化脚本，是商业工具的绝佳替代。适合需高效视觉沟通的开发者、设计师及普通用户，尤其适用于频繁截图并需快速分享或归档的场景。",
        "es": "ShareX is a free, open-source screen capture and file sharing tool that streamlines capturing, annotating, and uploading screenshots or recordings. Its key strength lies in its extensive customization: users can define workflows with custom hotkeys, choose from over 80 upload destinations (e.g., Imgur, Dropbox), and apply post-capture actions like OCR or image effects. Built in C#, it offers a lightweight yet powerful alternative to proprietary tools. Developers can extend its functionality via plugins or integrate it into automation pipelines. Ideal for developers, designers, and anyone needing efficient visual communication.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "ShareX stands out for avalonia, capture, and color-picker in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "ShareX is a free, open-source screen capture and file sharing tool that streamlines capturing, annotating, and uploading screenshots or recordings. Its key strength lies in its extensive customization: users can define workflows with custom hotkeys, choose from over 80 upload destinations (e.g., Imgur, Dropbox), and apply post-capture actions like OCR or image effects. Built in C#, it offers a lightweight yet powerful alternative to proprietary tools. Developers can extend its functionality via plugins or integrate it into automation pipelines. Ideal for developers, designers, and anyone needing efficient visual communication.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/ShareX/ShareX for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
